<title>UK: DSL Bank sets 400 million Danish crown bond.</title>
<headline>DSL Bank sets 400 million Danish crown bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>DSL Bank has launched a 400 million Danish crown eight-year structured bond paying 5.125 percent for the first four years, lead manager Kredietbank said.</p>
<p>The deal was priced at 101.90.</p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p> BORROWER   DSL DEUTSCHE SIEDLUNGS-UND LANDESRENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DKK   COUPON     5.125     MATURITY    03.DEC.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.90    PAY DATE    03.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	LISTING    =	   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.375     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
